OL,3,AFort Hood attacker's execution by
OL,4,Afiring squad will be livestreamed,
OL,5,APentagon says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe public will be able to watch the
OL,8,Fexecution of a former US Army major by
OL,9,Ffiring squad, US Defence Secretary Pete
OL,10,FHegseth has said.
OL,12,FAn official from the Defense Department
OL,13,Ftold the BBC the execution of Nidal
OL,14,FHasan, who fatally shot 13 unarmed US
OL,15,Fsoldiers at Fort Hood in 2009, would be
OL,16,Flivestreamed.
OL,18,FThe Pentagon had announced earlier this
OL,19,Fweek that it would execute Hasan in the
OL,20,Ffirst military execution in more than
OL,21,F60 years.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
