OL,3,AFort Hood attacker's execution by
OL,4,Afiring squad will be livestreamed,
OL,5,APentagon says
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We'll make sure that people are able
OL,8,Fto watch it, that it's public," Hegseth
OL,9,Fsaid on Thursday. "Because people need
OL,10,Fto understand that there's serious
OL,11,Fconsequences for these types of
OL,12,Fthings."
